WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.480
Hello everyone today I'll introduce my Antigravity IDE setup

2
00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.540
First of all my vision for this IDE

3
00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:12.620
is to build it into an all-in-one multimedia development center

4
00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:15.020
meaning this is a versatile

5
00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:17.260
multi-project centralized workspace

6
00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:19.620
Taking game development as an example

7
00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:22.220
it involves many distinct workflows

8
00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:24.660
and when working within the IDE

9
00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.900
it can be organized into distinct folders for management

10
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:33.180
Here I structured multiple project folders for a streamlined pipeline

11
00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:36.640
where each workspace has its dedicated AI folder

12
00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:40.400
to manage AI Rules and Skills

13
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.520
However during actual production

14
00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:48.080
relying solely on the vanilla IDE with AI for planning and creation

15
00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:51.060
revealed many friction points and limitations

16
00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:55.140
So I built several native tools to solve these workflow challenges
